        "filing_date": "2026-03-19",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "After the acquisition of Twill in 2024 and integrating its commercial offerings and technological platform with ours, we are now prepared to execute our growth strategies to both drive top line growth and to do so with greater operating efficiency that we believe will enable profitable growth.",
        "start_character": 27792,
        "end_character": 28086
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-031621",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-031621-0968a926624e60de",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-031621",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As a result, no assurance can be given that we will be able to satisfy the regulatory requirements to sell our products in any such country.",
        "start_character": 88199,
        "end_character": 88339
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-031621",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-031621-0968a926624e60de",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-031621",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "If these rules are determined to be applicable to us and if we were found to be noncompliant, we could lose our licensure in that state, which could prohibit us from selling our current or future products to patients in that state.",
        "start_character": 106056,
        "end_character": 106287
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-031621",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-031621-0968a926624e60de",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-031621",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-19",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we are partnering with clinical healthcare providers to add virtual clinical care to our digital health offerings and virtual coaching.",
        "start_character": 25011,
        "end_character": 25159
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-031621",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-031621-0968a926624e60de",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-031621",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we have developed DarioSHIFT, an operations initiative focused on using AI agents and tools and agentic AI capabilities to improve the efficiency and scalability of our business operations.",
        "start_character": 43910,
        "end_character": 44112
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-031621",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-031621-0968a926624e60de",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-031621",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we use the D2C market as an innovation laboratory to develop and test new features and benefits to ensure that these innovations meet our high engagement and outcomes standards before deploying them in the business-to-business (“B2B”) market.",
        "start_character": 5583,
        "end_character": 5838
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-031621",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-031621-0968a926624e60de",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-031621",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-19",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Some customers or other service providers may respond to these evolving laws and regulations by asking us to make certain privacy or data-related contractual commitments that we are unable or unwilling to make.",
        "start_character": 123900,
        "end_character": 124110
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-031621",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-031621-0968a926624e60de",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-031621",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are the only provider in the market with a comprehensive whole-person digital health offering supported by RCTs that demonstrate the clinical efficacy of its digital cognitive behavioral therapy and mindfulness interventions.",
        "start_character": 30296,
        "end_character": 30524
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-031621",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-031621-0968a926624e60de",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-031621",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-19",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We can also provide our services on either a direct basis or through its claims-based billing.",
        "start_character": 37231,
        "end_character": 37325
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-031621",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-031621-0968a926624e60de",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-031621",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-19",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have modified our core weight management offering to complement GLP-1 onboarding and offboarding, as well as GLP-1 prescription services, creating an integrated experience for members using GLP-1 medications.",
        "start_character": 16203,
        "end_character": 16414
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-031621",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-031621-0968a926624e60de",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-031621",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-19",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have provided our engagement platform services to a dozen global pharmaceutical companies across nearly as many medical conditions.",
        "start_character": 9176,
        "end_character": 9310
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-031621",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-031621-0968a926624e60de",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-031621",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We offer the most comprehensive whole-person digital health offering in the market and can offer it as a bundled full-suite offering to employers and health plans where these customers can pay for the full bundle under any one of several revenue models such as PMPM, PEMPM, and milestone value-based.",
